; Victory check, once per turn
;
; Called at the start of every turn (#R$96B3). Does nothing unless the valuable
; treasure (OBJ_VALUABLE_TREASURE) is held by the wooden chest (OBJ_WOODEN_CHEST).
; Then prints the ending ("a cheering crowd of dwarves, hobbits and elves
; appears. Led by gandalf they carry you off into the sunset, proclaiming you
; hero of heroes and master adventurer !!!") and goes to the end of the game
; at #R$90DF: the score, a key and the restart.
; .
; Hardware: none.
@label=CheckVictory
@isub=LD A,(Obj23TreasureHolder)
c$A9D6 LD A,($C5CE)         ; holder of the treasure
@isub=CP OBJ_WOODEN_CHEST
 $A9D9 CP $25
 $A9DB RET NZ               ; not in the chest yet
 $A9DC LD HL,$B3D9          ; the ending text
 $A9DF CALL $72DD
 $A9E2 JP $90DF             ; wait for a key and restart (EndGame_Wait)
